178	/**
179	 * One admitted instance, recorded with the corroboration that admitted it, so
180	 * the receipt shows the evidence rather than the verdict. `cancelled` is the
181	 * number of times this exact fetch was cancelled in this run;
182	 * `corroboratingSuccesses` is the number of times the same page fetched the
183	 * same path and method successfully, and must be at least one.
