193	/**
194	 * Accounting for the cancelled-duplicate-fetch category. This is a category,
195	 * not an allowance: it removes nothing from the evidence, it re-files a named
196	 * and corroborated browser behavior into its own inventory where every instance
197	 * is recorded individually. Every other failed request continues through the
198	 * exact {@link WitnessFailedRequestInventory} and still fails the run, and a
199	 * cancelled fetch that matches `category` but finds no successful sibling is
200	 * left in that inventory too — which is to say it fails.
201	 *
